{"id":"b4f8deeb-780e-4c62-8c92-3168e2586d25","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:25:34.523Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Martin möchte ein Beet anlegen. Das Beet soll quadratisch mit einer Länge von "},{"type":"math","src":"0,5m","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,5m"}]},{"text":" werden. Im Baumarkt will er sich nun spezielle Erde kaufen."}]}],"id":"f7ea556f-cde5-4133-99d2-f62fc06bb452"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Seine Mutter hat bereits Erfahrung im Anlegen eines Beets. Sie meint, dass ein Beutel für "},{"type":"math","src":"0,15m^2","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,15m^2"}]},{"text":" ausreicht. Reicht Martin ein Beutel, oder muss er mehr kaufen?"}]}],"id":"42acd113-89d1-46db-8aac-d73aa63a3f0e"}],"id":"450eb31d-83bf-40dc-8309-e958332b0780"},"interactive":{"plugin":"scMcExercise","state":{"isSingleChoice":true,"answers":[{"content":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ja, ein Beutel reicht."}]}],"id":"c9f98ea0-ff10-4732-af21-26bd88f055c8"},"isCorrect":false,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Überprüfe dein Ergebnis noch einmal. Leider ist ein Beutel noch zu wenig."}]}],"id":"2c257914-dcf8-408b-9a8f-0becfec3beaf"}},{"content":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nein, ein Beutel reicht nicht."}]}],"id":"a874a0ec-eee6-4e7a-93f5-a1b6a7c9dbbc"},"isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Er benötigt mehr, nämlich zwei Beutel."}]}],"id":"08bf6cb8-efa4-48a1-9cfb-99ec198b41d6"}}]},"id":"8cc910a8-1e4f-4d3f-8e74-3c417e967f1f"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"1863","title":"Quadrat"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"79f791b9-cf56-4237-99d0-5292ff605df0"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Fläche für das Beet lässt sich mit der Formel für den Flächeninhalt eines Quadrats errechnen, wenn man für "},{"type":"math","src":"a","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a"}]},{"text":" "},{"type":"math","src":"0,5m","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,5"}]},{"text":" einsetzt:"}]}],"id":"e2585357-150e-4813-871e-d4a05ad6aaf7"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
A_{Beet}&=&a^2
\\\\&=&(0,5m)^2
\\\\&=& 0,25m^2
\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"A"}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"9895b0a8-1c1b-4bb4-876e-372b17b21558"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Da ein Beutel nur für "},{"type":"math","src":"0,15m^2","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,15m"}]},{"text":" reicht muss er mehr nehmen."}]}],"id":"a11d283b-e54a-4a6d-afee-5e1177b87999"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zwei Beutel entsprechen "},{"type":"math","src":"2\cdot0,15m^2 = 0,3m^2","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"2"}]},{"text":" ."}]}],"id":"850c5757-b657-4f06-aca2-fe697e69ac55"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zwei Beutel sind also genug, denn Martin hätte nur "},{"type":"math","src":"0,25m^2","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"0,25"}]},{"text":" gebraucht."}]}],"id":"68b0c813-fdea-49f1-b616-1ec3c18da00d"}],"id":"860e6760-de98-4b00-898b-cc46da44fb49"}},"id":"d6430dae-3314-4a40-bd4e-9f30708a68b7"}},"id":"47b75b56-9aaa-420b-b0c0-35bf6f0ffc3c"}}
